  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Blue Carbon Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fund will promote the sustainable management, conservation and restoration of mangrove habitats by developing and embedding operational blue carbon markets across the Caribbean and Latin America that provide local communities with a sustainable income and assist in moving low-income countries towards low-emission, climate-resilient development.</narrative>
  </description>
